CORE
LinkedListCopy
--function LinkedListCopy.testCopyCtor --unwind 8 -cp target/classes:../../../lib/java-models-library/target/core-models.jar:../../../lib/java-models-library/target/cprover-api.jar
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR
^.*FAILURE$
--
Regression for LinkedList(Collection<? extends E> c)
constructor.

Pre-fix: the constructor ignored c entirely and produced a list
with nondet size and no elements. Verification of any property
that depended on the copied contents silently failed.

Post-fix: when the source is a LinkedList, the constructor
copies elementData via non-overlapping System.arraycopy and
sets size accordingly.
